4.4 Self-Service Options
Identify and publish low-risk work the business can handle without Legal, for example:
• Standard NDAs on approved paper
• Pre-approved vendor agreements under a defined value threshold
• Standard sales terms with approved fallback positions
• Frequently asked questions (signature authority, document retention, trademark use)
Set clear guardrails and escalation triggers for each.

