7.2 Contract Playbook Structure

For each contract type (NDA, MSA, SaaS, DPA, services, procurement, etc.), document:
• Standard position (preferred language)
• Acceptable fallback (pre-approved alternatives)
• Escalation trigger (when it must go to a senior attorney or the GC)
• Rationale (so reviewers understand the risk behind the clause)
Key clauses to cover: limitation of liability, indemnification, IP ownership and licensing, confidentiality, data protection, term and termination, governing law, warranties, payment terms, insurance, and assignment.

